  "goodToKnow": "Die Parodie is a parody: eine Parodie auf etwas (a parody of something). Parodieren means to parody or impersonate: Politiker parodieren. Michael Bully Herbig's Der Schuh des Manitu (2001), a parody of the Karl May Westerns, was one of the most successful German films ever. In German copyright law, parody is explicitly permitted since 2021. Stressed on the last syllable. Plural: die Parodien."
